#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_contract_minimum_term.field_product_template__contract_duration_type
msgid ""
"Fixed Duration: the contract line ends after the duration, it can be renewed automatically.\n"
"Minimum Term: the contract line is open-ended, it cannot be terminated before the end of the minimum term, which is extended by the renewal term if the contract is not terminated in time."
msgstr ""

